      <chord name="A7"/>Of <chord name="D"/>rocks and <chord name="A"/>trees, of <chord name="A7"/>skies and <chord name="D"/>seas; His hand the <chord name="A"/>won<chord name="A7"/>ders <chord name="D"/>wrought.
